<title>UK: EIB adds 300 mln Ffr to structured 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>EIB adds 300 mln Ffr to structured 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been</p>
<p>increased to 1.3 billion French francs from 1.0 billion francs,</p>
<p>lead manager Goldman Sachs (Paris) said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.3 BLN FFR   COUPON   **4.25	MATURITY    18.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE   STRUCTURED    ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    18.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.325     REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    PAR/LUX   PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 100-1M    SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    FRENCH    HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> NOTES	**FOR FIRST FIVE YEARS, THE TEC10 LESS 0.42 PCT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
